docs {
  # Fryday Triton (KServe v2 API)

  Start the server with `make triton` (HTTP :8010, metrics :8002), pick the **Local**
  environment, then run any request. Folders follow Triton's API areas: health, server,
  models, inference, statistics, metrics, admin.

  Run every request from the terminal: `npx @usebruno/cli run --env Local` in this folder.
}
